#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:5
#: 2cda97afa9ac4573a49d32895173800d
msgid "First Flight Tests"
msgstr "首次飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:9
#: 160d294400db41d98e99336b193cadb1
msgid "First Spool Up"
msgstr "首次旋翼加速启动"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:11
#: 129e9fa775504c16acdd8ed695376b03
msgid ""
"Check the CG of helicopter. It should be exactly on the point of the main "
"shaft. If not, adjust battery until it is."
msgstr "检查直升机的重心。重心应正好在主轴的中心点上。如果不是，调整电池位置直到满足要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:13
#: dcf803dca3784131a7b2f19f52b15d9a
msgid ""
"For the first spool up, before trying to lift into hover, you should verify "
"that the main rotor blades are tracking reasonably well. If not, excessive "
"vibration will be created, perhaps high enough to cause attitude control "
"errors or even cause an :ref:`ekf-inav-failsafe`."
msgstr ""
"在首次旋翼加速启动时，在尝试悬停起飞之前，您应验证主旋翼桨叶的跟踪是否合理。如果不合理，将产生过大的震动，可能足以导致姿态控制错误，甚至触发 "
":ref:`ekf-inav-failsafe`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:15
#: c49c300a1b6e4295902840d3bc412afa
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle. If there is a pre-arm failure, resolve it before "
"proceeding. Usually you will need to wait until the GPS obtains lock and the"
" EKF sets its origin as indicated by the ground control station messages "
"(and, of course, the failure to arm!)"
msgstr ""
"解锁飞行器。如果有预解锁失败，请在继续之前解决。通常您需要等待 GPS 获得锁定，EKF 设置其原点，如地面控制站消息所示（当然，还有解锁失败的提示！）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:16
#: b4fafd5d11f74120914ebef74da7e39a
msgid ""
"Before the automatic disarming timing elapses, engage the Motor Interlock "
"switch and/or raise the collective above 1/4 stick (if using passthru RSC "
"mode)to enable Motor Interlock. The rotor should spool up to speed. Usually,"
" one spools up at 0 deg collective pitch setting to avoid stress while on "
"the ground"
msgstr ""
"在自动上锁计时结束之前，接合电机联锁开关和/或将总距抬高到 1/4 摇杆以上（如果使用直通 RSC 模式）以启用电机联锁。旋翼应加速到转速。通常在 0 "
"度总距位置加速，以避免在地面时产生应力"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:17
#: eb49f388e9904109b9232816983b35d7
msgid ""
"At this point, check that the blades are tracking. If not, adjust a blade's "
"pitch link to the swashplate and re-try until the plane of both blades is "
"close to identical."
msgstr "此时，检查桨叶是否正常跟踪。如果不是，调整一片桨叶到斜盘的俯仰连杆并重试，直到两片桨叶的旋转平面接近相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:21
#: 242ad7dae5f74b1db48b8e3fb1b48851
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Traditional Helicopter Tips <traditional-helicopter-tips>` for "
"more on vibration issues."
msgstr "有关震动问题的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`传统直升机技巧 <traditional-helicopter-tips>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:24
#: bdaef38de6b14617945c38c9832609bf
msgid "First Hover"
msgstr "首次悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:26
#: 5f99de30c67a40c18422101036cdb86f
msgid ""
"Once tracking has been verified, you can do your first test hover. In "
"STABILIZE, repeat the above, but once the rotor has finished spooling up, "
"increase collective slowly and lift off. Be prepared to  put in small cyclic"
" corrections to hover the vehicle in place. If the vehicle seems too "
"unstable in attitude, you might try setting the PID values to those used for"
" beginning the fine tuning of the attitude control loops, discussed in the "
"following section (:ref:`traditional-helicopter-tuning` )."
msgstr ""
"验证跟踪后，可以进行首次测试悬停。在 Stabilize "
"模式下，重复上述步骤，但旋翼加速完成后，缓慢增加总距并起飞。准备好进行小幅横向循环校正以将飞行器保持在原地悬停。如果飞行器的姿态稳定性看起来太差，您可以尝试将"
" PID 值设置为用于开始精细调参姿态控制回路时所使用的值，如下一节（:ref:`traditional-helicopter-tuning`）所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:29
#: 536f09dd80dd4b0a8615bcf01b6e5840
msgid "Hover Trim"
msgstr "悬停配平"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:31
#: a49a066a7dbb4e5ab7c08354a54e1ce7
msgid ""
"Trimming the helicopter in pitch and roll axes is an important step to keep "
"the aircraft from drifting in modes like Stabilize and Althold.  The trim "
"attitude in the roll axis is affected by the tail rotor thrust.  All "
"conventional single- rotor helicopters with a torque-compensating tail rotor"
" hover either right skid low or left skid low, depending on which way the "
"main rotor turns. The ArduCopter software has a parameter, "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>`, to compensate for this "
"phenomenon. Dual rotor helicopters have counter rotating rotor systems which"
" mostly cancel the torque.  For these aircraft, the "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` should be set to zero. "
"Longitudinal CG location will affect the trim attitude in the pitch axis.  "
"There is no parameter to tell the autopilot what pitch attitude the aircraft"
" hovers with no drift. It always targets zero deg pitch as measured by the "
"autopilot. Therefore the actual pitch attitude the aircraft hovers may be 5 "
"deg nose high but the autopilot AHRS Trim value is set to make it think the "
"attitude is zero deg."
msgstr ""
"在俯仰和横滚轴上对直升机进行配平是防止飞行器在 Stabilize 和 AltHold "
"等模式下漂移的重要步骤。横滚轴的配平姿态受尾旋翼推力的影响。所有带有扭矩补偿尾旋翼的传统单旋翼直升机悬停时，右踏板低或左踏板低，取决于主旋翼的旋转方向。ArduCopter"
" 软件有一个参数 :ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` "
"来补偿这一现象。双旋翼直升机具有反转旋翼系统，大部分抵消了扭矩。对于这些飞行器，:ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>`"
" "
"应设为零。纵向重心位置将影响俯仰轴的配平姿态。没有参数可告知飞控飞行器无漂移悬停时的俯仰姿态。它始终以飞控测量的零度俯仰为目标。因此，飞行器实际悬停的俯仰姿态可能是机头上仰"
" 5 度，但飞控 AHRS 配平值设置为使其认为姿态为零度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:46
#: a82c770fd0a248e89c75d31388745e48
msgid ""
"During the initial setup of the autopilot, the ``AHRS_TRIM_x`` values are "
"set during the accelerometer calibration on the step that has you level the "
"aircraft. For that step you should have made certain that the shaft was "
"perfectly straight up in pitch and roll. If the accelerometers are already "
"calibrated, the AHRS trim can be set without having to redo the entire "
"calibration process.  In QGround Control, go to Vehicle Setup and click on "
"the sensors tab on the left.  Use the Level Horizon button to set the AHRS "
"TRIM's.  In Mission Planner, goto the Setup Page and click on Accel "
"Calibration under Mandatory Hardware on the left side.  Use the Calibrate "
"Level button to set AHRS_TRIM's."
msgstr ""
"在飞控初始设置期间，``AHRS_TRIM_x`` "
"值在要求您将飞行器调平的加速度计校准步骤中设置。在该步骤中，您应确保主轴在俯仰和横滚方向上完全垂直。如果加速度计已校准，可以不重新进行完整校准流程而直接设置"
" AHRS 配平。在 QGroundControl 中，进入飞行器设置并点击左侧的传感器选项卡。使用水平地平线按钮设置 AHRS TRIM。在 "
"Mission Planner 中，进入设置页面并点击左侧必要硬件下的加速度计校准。使用校准水平按钮设置 AHRS_TRIM。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:55
#: 3df65911a81a43d0993e229af9b37f32
msgid ""
"The autopilot now \"knows\" when the mainshaft is perfectly vertical.  The "
"above is necessary so roll angle to set the "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` can be accurately measured."
msgstr ""
"飞控现在\"知道\"主轴完全垂直时的状态。以上操作是必要的，以便准确测量横滚角来设置 "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:58
#: d51457681832478bac1f8ff9ba165ebf
msgid ""
"In order to trim the aircraft, set the "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` parameter to zero. Load the "
"helicopter with its normal payload, and hover the helicopter in no-wind "
"conditions in Stabilize flight mode. Land it and pull the log, noting the "
"roll angle and pitch angle that you had to hold with the stick to keep the "
"helicopter from drifting. Enter the roll angle value in the "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` parameter in centidegrees. For a "
"CW turning main rotor if it took 3.5 degrees of right roll to compensate, "
"enter 350. Negative values are for a CCW turning main rotor that requires "
"left roll to compensate. If the pitch angle was not zero to keep the "
"helicopter from drifting, then enter the pitch attitude required for no "
"drift in the :ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y<AHRS_TRIM_Y>` in radians (which is the angle "
"in degrees divided by 57.3). If it took 2 degrees nose down (-2 deg) to "
"hover then you would enter -0.0349 radians into "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y<AHRS_TRIM_Y>`."
msgstr ""
"为了配平飞行器，将 :ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` 参数设为零。用正常载荷装载直升机，在无风条件下以"
" Stabilize 飞行模式悬停直升机。降落后调取日志，记录为保持直升机不漂移所需的横滚角和俯仰角。将横滚角值（厘度）输入 "
":ref:`ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM<ATC_HOVR_ROL_TRM>` 参数。对于顺时针旋转的主旋翼，如果需要 3.5 "
"度右横滚来补偿，则输入 "
"350。负值适用于逆时针旋转的主旋翼，需要左横滚来补偿。如果俯仰角不为零才能保持直升机不漂移，则将保持无漂移所需的俯仰姿态（弧度）输入 "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y<AHRS_TRIM_Y>` （即角度除以 57.3）。如果需要机头下俯 2 度（-2 度）才能悬停，则在 "
":ref:`AHRS_TRIM_Y<AHRS_TRIM_Y>` 中输入 -0.0349 弧度。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:69
#: 0ccb45e7a2ad46048199f1aace960e95
msgid ""
"Do not use the radio trims at all. Make sure they are at the same position "
"as when the :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration` was done."
msgstr "完全不要使用遥控器配平。确保它们与 :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration` 完成时的位置相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:71
#: 66316002b7d54b08a6a9ac30b43b16bc
msgid ""
"Your helicopter is now trimmed properly. If you hover the aircraft and it "
"still drifts, check that the aircraft is actually holding the hover attitude"
" determined above with the stick centered.  If it does not, then consult the"
" Setting ILMI and IMAX section of the :ref:`Additional Tuning Topics "
"<traditional-helicopter-tuning-other-topics>` wiki. This trimming procedure "
"makes the difference between a helicopter that is difficult to handle vs one"
" that flies with true scale quality and handling."
msgstr ""
"您的直升机现在已正确配平。如果悬停飞行器时仍有漂移，请检查飞行器是否在摇杆居中时实际保持了上面确定的悬停姿态。如果没有，请参阅 :ref:`附加调参主题"
" <traditional-helicopter-tuning-other-topics>` wiki 中的设置 ILMI 和 IMAX "
"部分。这个配平程序决定了直升机是难以操控的还是具有真实比例质量和操控性的。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:78
#: 9331454a25d44dd49f8550ef96d1a5df
msgid "Enable Notch Filtering"
msgstr "启用陷波滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:80
#: 9b84df7347ba492f92c03bc16ab8edcc
msgid ""
"Assuming that first low in-place hover was successful, which it should be if"
" you have followed the wiki, you should setup a dynamic harmonic notch "
"filter. Tuning of the control loops, which is the next step, is greatly "
"enhanced if the vehicle's generated vibrations are attenuated by the filter."
msgstr ""
"假设第一次低空就地悬停成功（如果您按照 wiki "
"操作应该成功），您应该设置动态谐波陷波滤波器。控制回路调参是下一步，如果飞行器产生的震动被滤波器衰减，调参效果将大大增强。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:82
#: 5423f27299e6404eb7a56e137c88b9ca
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in :ref:`Helicopter Dynamic Notch Filter "
"Setup<common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`直升机动态陷波滤波器设置<common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup>` 中的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:84
#: 13ba5d35ebb34ee88184c5c411ed964f
msgid ""
"There usually are two rotational vibration sources in Traditional "
"Helicopters, the main rotor and the tail rotor. The tail rotor frequency may"
" appear as if its a harmonic of the main rotor, but not quite at an integer "
"multiple of the main rotor fundamental frequency. For example, if the tail "
"rotor has a 1:3.8 gearing to the main rotor, it will appear near what would "
"be the 4th harmonic of the main rotor, but is slightly lower (ie 3.8x the "
"fundamental of the main rotor). In this case, the harmonic notch setup for "
"the 4th harmonic may still be effective if the bandwidth of the notches, "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW<INS_HNTCH_BW>`,are wide enough."
msgstr ""
"传统直升机通常有两个旋转震动源，主旋翼和尾旋翼。尾旋翼频率可能看起来像主旋翼的谐波，但不完全是主旋翼基频的整数倍。例如，如果尾旋翼与主旋翼的传动比为 "
"1:3.8，它将出现在接近主旋翼第 4 次谐波的位置，但略低（即主旋翼基频的 3.8 倍）。在这种情况下，针对第 4 次谐波的谐波陷波设置如果陷波带宽 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW<INS_HNTCH_BW>` 足够宽，可能仍然有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-first-flight-tests.rst:86
#: 29359bce643c47ba96ecad67442239b4
msgid ""
"After the harmonic notch is setup, proceed to :ref:`traditional-helicopter-"
"tuning`."
msgstr "谐波陷波设置完成后，继续进行 :ref:`traditional-helicopter-tuning`。"
